{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "d677eeaf-c888-49f3-85d3-b67fa5f9051a",
    "name": "📌 Alibaba Cloud API (Aliyun)",
    "description": "### About Alibaba Cloud (Aliyun)\n\n\"Alibaba Cloud is one of the world's largest cloud computing companies, providing scalable, secure, and reliable cloud computing services globally to accelerate digitalization empowered by comprehensive cloud products and solutions.\"\n\nAlibaba Cloud builds its own Qwen models and, through Model Studio, also hosts models from other labs such as DeepSeek and GLM. On the workspace overview it is listed under **Cloud platforms**.\n\n### Prerequisites\n\n- Postman Account\n    \n- Alibaba Cloud Account: [https://account.alibabacloud.com/](https://account.alibabacloud.com/)\n    \n\n### Usage\n\n1. Create a fork\n    \n2. Update collection variables\n    \n3. Send requests\n    \n\nStart with the 🚀 Get Started folder.\n\nAdd your key to your **Postman Vault** as `alibaba_cloud_api_key` (Vault icon in the footer, then **Add secret**, using that exact name). Requests read it as `{{vault:alibaba_cloud_api_key}}`, so your key never leaves your device.\n\n### Documentation\n\n- API: [https://modelstudio.console.alibabacloud.com/](https://modelstudio.console.alibabacloud.com/)\n    \n- Models: [https://modelstudio.console.alibabacloud.com/](https://modelstudio.console.alibabacloud.com/)",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "createdAt": "2025-08-02T02:12:42.000Z",
